SUMMARY:Gallery Opening with Asaya & Gwanzo
LOCATION:Arkhe Gallery
DESCRIPTION:From the West Coast of British Columbia\, Gwanzo always bring a
  fresh vibe to the dancefloor ! Sexy\, dubby\, bassy\, he will make your b
 ooty shake and put a smile on your face. Inspired by BC festivals scene an
 d psychedelic in general\, his set are more on the journey side\, bringing
  you on a trip across many emotions\, many textures\, many colors. He's an
 other wizard recalibrating the grid with vibrations. Let's keep elevating 
 our species with conscious sounds.\n\nSoundCloud: https://on.soundcloud.co
 m/E86peQ1IsS68GzfJ83\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/gwanzo.art?igsh
 =M3Uwc2NqOHdjcXl6\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/triskelion.trip?ig
 sh=MWh5bWRiaXJ4ZXlmYg==\n\nProfile: https://thenectarfestival.com/products
 /gwanzo
END:VEVENT
