SUMMARY:Glyde
LOCATION:Arkhe Gallery
DESCRIPTION:Montreal born musician turned west coast audiophile \, Greg Mar
 ino is a surfer of both water and sound waves. He weaves all kinds of infl
 uence into his music and curates ambient guitar and voice driven loops.\n\
 nSpotify: https://open.spotify.com/artist/1NH5scXCAZUJidfpKqTQb4?si=o09PY4
 yZQwiCeKEd2UoW5A\nInstagram: http://www.instagram.com/glyde.grego\n\nProfi
 le: https://thenectarfestival.com/products/glyde-1
