SUMMARY:MOTR (Mind of the Rabbit)
LOCATION:Arkhe Gallery
DESCRIPTION:M o t R  (Mind of the Rabbit) is a long time Salt Spring Islan
 d resident who has been hiding in the woods creating analogue synth and sa
 mple based music for many years. It’s taken a long time to build the stu
 dio and collect all the mystery boxes necessary to make the bits and beats
 . The tracks I create fall roughly under the genres Glitch Ambient and Dow
 n Tempo Dub House.\n\nSoundCloud: https://on.soundcloud.com/p1wCdtoRRZPWWF
 TzUbz\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/jrobertmoss\n\nProfile: https:
 //thenectarfestival.com/products/m-o-t-r-mind-of-the-rabbit
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:d136bbd1-7f96-431e-b5ce-d74d0e21ea69@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T150000
SUMMARY:Andromeda's Ocean
LOCATION:Arkhe Gallery
DESCRIPTION:Andromedas Ocean is an emerging Salt Spring artist\, writing an
 d singing music for all starry sirens and forest fae alike. Music that com
 es from the depths of her heart and soul. Oceanic frequencies dancing upon
  raw emotional story telling\, only the kind that comes from deep within l
 ove's humanly perceived and colourful experiences.\n\nFollowing the releas
 e of The Ocean\, she now steps onto the sweet Nectar festival grounds for 
 the first time\, sharing her songs\, her heart and soul with you all.\n\nW
 ebsite: https://kylamcmahon67.wixsite.com/website\nInstagram: https://www.
 instagram.com/andromedas.ocean\nYouTube: https://youtube.com/@andromedasoc
 ean?si=RHbPzO2u7YDaUiU1\nSpotify: https://open.spotify.com/track/6epmhb4wE
 IVZdVsImF4RPg?si=rdWzPfR3TSmLKw9GlOpMFA\n\nProfile: https://thenectarfesti
 val.com/products/andromedas-ocean
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:3c9c3d24-9701-45e2-8d54-f22ff067d837@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T170000
SUMMARY:Delakit Presents Fairy Tea Party
LOCATION:Arkhe Gallery
DESCRIPTION:Delakit (pronounced Delicate) is an artist\, DJ\, and vocalist 
 who brings intention and play to the dancefloor\, weaving spoken word\, st
 orytelling\, and melodic soundscapes into each set. As her name suggests\,
  Delakit thrives in times where ethereal sounds can be felt—sunset and s
 unrise\, when familiar faces are bathed in golden rays of inspiration—ye
 t she is equally at home exploring the lush depths and sensuality of midni
 ght. Delakit has performed at festivals including Shambhala Music Festival
 \, Nectar Music Festival\, Event Horizon and Init Festival.\n\nSoundCloud:
  https://soundcloud.com/delakit\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/dela
 kiit/\nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VmtN83h1Nw8\n\nProfile: ht
 tps://thenectarfestival.com/products/delakit
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
